<h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="%E3%80%90%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8A%E7%8F%AD%E6%97%8F%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6%E9%BA%B5%E5%BA%97%E3%80%91"></span>【台中上班族推薦麵店】<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2>
<p><a href="https://orange-dog.com/meimen10/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">美味佳陽春麵│西屯(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/men3050/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">世紀小吃店│西屯(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/55men/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">五權小吃店│中區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/kaomen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">高家意麵│中區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/nonamemen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">上海未名麵點酸梅湯│中區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/alon/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">阿隆麵攤│西區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/5men/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">五街麵店│西區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/saltmen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">塩水麵店│西區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/sunmen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">廣日炒麵│西區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/taipeisquid/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">台北太祖魷魚羹│西區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/vegmen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">東海素食│北區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/simplemen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">東記傻瓜麵│北區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/ayomen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">阿有麵店│南屯(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/twinmen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">双生的店黑白切│北屯(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/weimen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">立偉麵食麻醬麵太原店│北屯(食記/地址/營業時間)</a><br />
<a href="https://orange-dog.com/rice70/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">傳正老牌香菇肉羹│東區(食記/地址/營業時間)</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51525307265_f01804abcf_b.jpg" /><br />
記得剛來台中前兩年，熱愛看電影的我遇見第一影城像是挖到寶，幾乎每個週末都泡在這裡，也因此週邊小店就是我解決三餐的好朋友，不管是<strong><a href="https://orange-dog.com/rice70/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">正老牌香菇肉羹</a></strong>，或是<strong>高家意麵</strong>，又或者口渴就到青草街買杯青草茶，可惜了曾經的第一廣場之名也跟著影城也消失在歷史洪流之中，但幸好這些台中在地老味道還依舊留守在這個地方，<br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51524399591_c3bcac30ca_b.jpg" /><br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51524628063_20ff52191e_b.jpg" /><br />
<span style="color: #ff9900;"><strong>【高家意麵】</strong></span>是相當受歡迎的一家老麵店，疫情爆發期間卻一度暫停營業，現在規模稍微縮小成一家店面大小，但對我來說那不變的麻醬麵加碗餛飩湯的搭配幸好還在，偶爾中午、下午還是會來光顧一下。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51525277912_5584cccf27_b.jpg" /><div class='code-block code-block-5' style='margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;'>
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<!-- ac_post_img -->
<ins class="adsbygoogle"
     style="display:inline-block;width:100%;height:280px"
     data-ad-client="ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     data-ad-slot="9959682703"></ins>
<script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></div>
<br />
因為我找不到紙本MENU，所以只抬頭看到這個燈箱加減參考，麵類其實算是蠻便宜的，小碗份量不會很奈米，以我的食量一碗小麻醬麵或乾意麵+一碗餛飩湯就飽了！而這個搭配也是不少老客人的最愛，小菜不管哪種都是均一價每份30元，一盤的份量很適合兩個人一起吃的時候點。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51523594017_c7336e0985_b.jpg" /></p>
<h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="%E3%80%90%E6%8B%9B%E7%89%8C%E9%BA%BB%E9%86%AC%E9%BA%B540%E5%85%83%E4%B9%BE%E6%84%8F%E9%BA%B535%E5%85%83%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6%E6%90%AD%E9%A4%9B%E9%A3%A9%E6%B9%AF%E3%80%91"></span>【招牌麻醬麵40元/乾意麵35元(推薦搭餛飩湯)】<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2>
<p>以小碗麵來說，高家的份量算是蠻不錯的，剛端上桌乍看麻醬哪去了，其實醬汁在上面，加少少許燙豆芽菜跟小白菜，小碗麵量還不少，但其實拌下去就知道麵醬在下面，在麻醬跟湯水拿捏的比例還不錯，輕鬆就能讓麵條均勻完整沾上麻醬吃起來還不會很快就變乾乾的，麻醬香不至於到超濃郁但恰到好處，還有古早味肉燥的點綴更是不可少，<br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51524634228_121e5bfff2_b.jpg" /><br />
麵條更不會軟爛，都是很剛好的口感上桌，香濃Q彈好吃也夠味，幾乎看店內要不就點麻醬麵，<br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51523595417_bf8162f522_b.jpg" /><br />
要不就是乾意麵居多，相較於麻醬麵顯得較為素雅，但其實滷汁不會清淡加上肉燥也夠香，好吃度也是挺不錯的。<br />
這天拍照唯獨忘記點餛飩湯，不然平常這都是我來這吃麵必備的搭配，它們家餛飩湯30元CP值相當高！在台中幾家麵店的餛飩湯中，南屯萬和宮旁的<a href="https://orange-dog.com/ayomen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">阿有麵店餛飩</a>是我的最愛，高家意麵的應該也是近年喝過算喜歡的。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p><div class='code-block code-block-2' style='margin: 10px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;'>
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<!-- ac_post_mid -->
<ins class="adsbygoogle"
     style="display:inline-block;width:100%;height:280px"
     data-ad-client="ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     data-ad-slot="6949881144"></ins>
<script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></div>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51525143609_0ed29139ff_b.jpg" /></p>
<h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="%E3%80%90%E7%87%92%E8%B3%A3%E6%AF%8F%E5%80%8B15%E5%85%83%E2%94%82%E9%9B%9E%E6%8D%B230%E5%85%83%E2%94%82%E7%87%99%E9%9D%92%E8%8F%9C30%E5%85%83%E3%80%91"></span>【燒賣/每個15元│雞捲30元│燙青菜30元】<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2>
<p>來了好幾次才看到別桌客人點<strong>巨無霸燒賣</strong>引我的好奇心，<strong>每顆燒賣比起一般港點燒賣更大上一倍</strong>，視覺很吸引人注意，皮薄、內餡應該是用蘿蔔絲、筍絲、絞肉+魚漿去蒸熟，吃起來有點像台灣小吃雞捲、肉捲那種感覺跟調味，<br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51524409616_cd63798168_b.jpg" /><div class='code-block code-block-5' style='margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;'>
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<!-- ac_post_img -->
<ins class="adsbygoogle"
     style="display:inline-block;width:100%;height:280px"
     data-ad-client="ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     data-ad-slot="9959682703"></ins>
<script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></div>
<br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51523599817_246a7da375_b.jpg" /><br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51524639743_78f63e5712_b.jpg" /><br />
還算可以，魚漿比例較多，但建議一次别點太多顆，熱的時候比較好吃(冷掉就&#8230;)，不是非吃不可。還點盤雞捲來吃吃份量也太大，這樣30元味道還OK，其他滷菜也都差不多這種份量；燙青菜也是不少人推薦，<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51525109079_cf658d7465_b.jpg" /><br />
<img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51525108489_1a1cf923e7_b.jpg" /><br />
30元一盤是目前各家麵攤差不多的價位，但有些店給的份量超奈米，高家意麵的算是蠻實惠的，而且是給燙小白菜，雖然並不是全部整盤都很嫩的口感，但這個CP值也不錯了。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51524400466_d03326a741_b.jpg" /><div class='code-block code-block-5' style='margin: 30px auto; text-align: center; display: block; clear: both;'>
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
<!-- ac_post_img -->
<ins class="adsbygoogle"
     style="display:inline-block;width:100%;height:280px"
     data-ad-client="ca-pub-3031326649973477"
     data-ad-slot="9959682703"></ins>
<script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></div>
<br />
從第一廣場到現在<strong>東協廣場</strong>，<strong>綠川水岸</strong>整個打造起來，週邊景觀也越來越不一樣，雖然說假日是大部份移工聚會的場所，但其實平日過來還挺悠閒的，餐館小吃輕鬆入座，路上也沒有擁擠人潮，還蠻適合來散步走走的，吃碗<strong>高家意麵</strong>喝個餛飩湯，去旁邊青草街來杯涼爽好茶，還有肚子也可以再過個馬路去宮原眼科來杯冰淇淋！推薦分享給大家！</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div style="text-align: center;"><strong><img decoding="async"  src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/51525307265_f01804abcf_b.jpg" /><br />
【如果你喜歡我的文章請幫我分享^^】</strong></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">======================================================</div>
<div style="orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2;">
