◎地址：<u><a href="https://www.google.com.tw/maps/place/400%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%82%E4%B8%AD%E5%8D%80%E7%B6%A0%E5%B7%9D%E8%A5%BF%E8%A1%97171%E8%99%9F/@24.1398415,120.6825417,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x34693d14c06dc387:0x3dcefaf3f9835a9a!8m2!3d24.1398366!4d120.6847304" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">台中市中區綠川西街171號</a></u></div>
